               libreadline-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/qdaemon/qdaemon
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: qd-dhcpd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: QDaemon Professional DHCP Server
 A professional DHCP server with the following features:
  - DHCP server with address pool management
  - DHCP relay agent support (RFC 3046 Option 82)
  - DHCP snooping via kernel module
  - CLI management interface
  - REST API for configuration
  - Lease persistence and management
 .
 This package contains the userspace daemon and CLI tools.

Package: qd-dhcpd-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, linux-headers-generic | linux-headers
Description: QDaemon DHCP Kernel Module (DKMS)
 Kernel module for DHCP packet interception and snooping.
 .
 Features:
  - Virtual network device (qdhcp0) for userspace communication
  - Dual interception methods: dev_add_pack() and TC ingress hook
  - DHCP snooping with binding table
  - Trusted/untrusted port classification
 .
 This package uses DKMS to automatically build and install
 the kernel module for your running kernel.
